  paragraphs:
  - "COSMO: Come in \u2018Bastion One\u2019 do you copy? "
  - 'BASTION ONE: Copy!

'
  - "COSMO: Let\u2019s not forget how important this mission is. We must eradicate
    these bugs before they have the chance to get their filth all over our home."
  - 'BAXTER: What do we know about our enemy, Captain?'
  - 'COSMO: Not much, our friends in the solar system went dark long before they
    could give us any valuable intel.'
  - "BAXTER: It doesn\u2019t matter. We\u2019ll crush them either way. "
  - 'BASTION ONE: Yeah!!!'
  - "COSMO: Settle down, while it\u2019s true we are the best, knowing is half the
    battle."
  - "PHOENIX: Are we approaching the location of the signal we picked up? I\u2019m
    not seeing anything. "
  - 'HOLT: I think I see-'
  - 'BAXTER: Holt! No!'
  - 'COSMO: Stay in formation, stay in formation!'
